@startuml centralAppControllerStateMachine
state Uninitialized
state Ready

[*] --> Uninitialized

Uninitialized --> Ready : Init()\n/ Init all downstream modules

Ready --> Ready : Dispatch()\n/ Parse -> Route -> Respond
Ready --> Uninitialized : DeInit()

note right of Ready
  Stateless dispatcher.
  Each Dispatch() call:
  1. Deserialize request
  2. Switch on SID
  3. Map DID/RID to downstream call
  4. Build response via Serialize
end note
@enduml